  "body": "## What's Changed\n\n- fix(playlist): play a queued next track once (#714) by bjarneo ([@bjarneo](https://github.com/bjarneo)) ([`f8a6f34`](https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/commit/f8a6f34cc7599fd91055b42126ff2174e5370cca))\n- fix(player): drop stale samples on a track switch (#713) by bjarneo ([@bjarneo](https://github.com/bjarneo)) ([`1fdc3a4`](https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/commit/1fdc3a41381defb6838972744161ad071d6c46b5))\n- fix(spotify): report audio key refusal as an error (#712) by bjarneo ([@bjarneo](https://github.com/bjarneo)) ([`d8cca67`](https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/commit/d8cca67d616d03e6d5e68781f5376691b6865530))\n- fix(netease): load every track of a playlist (#710) by bjarneo ([@bjarneo](https://github.com/bjarneo)) ([`c14b056`](https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/commit/c14b05634f88828ff810f25036eefca8c56a47e8))\n- fix(ui): hide album headers in shuffle order (#709) by bjarneo ([@bjarneo](https://github.com/bjarneo)) ([`ebc7b41`](https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/commit/ebc7b410c5cbe235cf8ea7374c08f3b7db967702))\n- fix: bump Go to 1.26.11 for govulncheck (#711) by bjarneo ([@bjarneo](https://github.com/bjarneo)) ([`85c933e`](https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/commit/85c933e888e041c22e03cc163305f91b7b6ba410))\n- chore(icon): redraw the app icon as a block equalizer (#708) by David Heinemeier Hansson ([@dhh](https://github.com/dhh)) ([`c0d9730`](https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/commit/c0d9730bec9a246d2981e314a9ec81e750e93e72))\n- Merge pull request #703 from lchojnack/fix/feed-title-entities by Lukasz Chojnacki ([@lchojnack](https://github.com/lchojnack)) ([`f43b9c1`](https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/commit/f43b9c144702a356f5bfa9225137ed2b6bbd2fb4))\n\n\n## Checksums (SHA256)\n\n```\nb78f79455e77d5048b24a24b438cbf0d41eb9e0d376e60dcca1e3d981b75c412  cliamp-darwin-amd64\n8fa560926d6bd7fbd93a5160917a31cdb9a86ae62db54946e8f22ae2fc0061d7  cliamp-darwin-arm64\ncb6e9a08f2b9617d56b5e472d08d3cd68ad1312a161224a33c6f82e26c1ab2b1  cliamp-linux-amd64\nf4e591542bb834fdff2ca21a85101e9b41a1dd35e28756eccfa1a42c265babb3  cliamp-linux-arm64\n821b66d7af77ac7ee965c9c9e91bb6bdc58469db68c07231236e06378a4a8058  cliamp-windows-amd64.exe\n88855765c4ea3b169b3d69f09cbe49492ceb5730d276f981615f42ddadad7ebc  cliamp-windows-amd64.zip\n```\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/compare/v2.4.0...v2.4.1\n"
